BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 780.00 Td (TIME-TRAVEL CLI v1.2 ‚Äî CTRL+Z FOR YOUR FILESYSTEM) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 768.00 Td (Pure C11 engine. Static binary ~174 KB \(musl-gcc + xdelta3\). Linux only.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 756.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 744.00 Td ("Serious versioning for those who want Ctrl+Z across their entire project.") Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 732.00 Td (Language:    C11 \(engine and CLI\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 720.00 Td (Binary:      Static CLI ~174 KB \(musl + xdelta3\), zero runtime dependencies) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 708.00 Td (Format:      TTDLTA01, packed little-endian records with xdelta3 deltas) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 696.00 Td (Status:      Production. Core validated with 51/51 regression tests.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 672.00 Td (v1.2 Extensions: dump, inter-revision diff, enhanced status.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 660.00 Td (v1.2 Extensions: `undo --to` accepts exact log dates \(YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS\).) Tj ET
