BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 504.00 Td (Key results on this hardware:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 492.00 Td (- 51/51 regression tests in ~1 minute 37 seconds) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 480.00 Td (- Daemon startup + initial cache: < 1 second for 500 files) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 468.00 Td (- Atomic restoration via temp+rename: zero partial writes) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 456.00 Td (- Burst capture of 500 files: all registered without loss) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 432.00 Td (If it works here, it works anywhere.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 420.00 Td (NOTE: All times mentioned were measured in the environment described above.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 396.00 Td (On modern hardware \(NVMe SSD, multi-core CPU\), results are orders of ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 384.00 Td (magnitude better.) Tj ET
