BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 780.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 768.00 Td (1. WHAT IS TIME-TRAVEL) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 756.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 732.00 Td (Time-Travel is a real-time file versioning daemon that watches a directory ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 720.00 Td (tree via inotify and records every change as compact xdelta3 deltas.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 696.00 Td (Think of it as "Ctrl+Z for your entire project folder":) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 672.00 Td (- Every edit, creation, and deletion is captured automatically.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 660.00 Td (- Restore any file or entire directory to any previous point in time.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 648.00 Td (- Named checkpoints \(tags\) for semantic rollback points.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 636.00 Td (- Diff between any two versions of a file.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 624.00 Td (- Full export of reconstructed versions and consecutive diffs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 612.00 Td (- Atomic writes: restorations never leave corrupted files.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 600.00 Td (- No initial backup: only changes are recorded \(copy-on-first-change\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 588.00 Td (- Per-file directory undo: each file reverts to its own previous version.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 576.00 Td (- Automatic daily compaction at 03:00.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 564.00 Td (- Robust exclusions: .git, node_modules, __pycache__, target, .cache.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 552.00 Td (- Enhanced status showing daemon state, CPU, RAM, records, and bytes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 528.00 Td (The final CLI binary is static, approximately 174 KB \(includes statically ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 516.00 Td (compiled xdelta3\), with zero external runtime dependencies.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 492.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 480.00 Td (2. ENGINE ARCHITECTURE) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 468.00 Td (==============================================================================) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 444.00 Td (The engine is organized in C11 modules with clear responsibilities.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 432.00 Td (+---------------------+------------------------------------------------------+) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 420.00 Td (| FILE                | RESPONSIBILITY                                       |) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 408.00 Td (+---------------------+------------------------------------------------------+) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 396.00 Td (| tt_types.h          | Base types, constants, cache and daemon structs      |) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 384.00 Td (| tt_store.c          | .ttd read/write, rotation, scan_stats                |) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 372.00 Td (| tt_delta.c          | xdelta3 encode/decode wrapper                        |) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 360.00 Td (| tt_filter.c         | Exclusion filter \(path_has_component, fnmatch\)       |) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 348.00 Td (| tt_debounce.c       | Event coalescing \(200 ms threshold, CLOSE_WRITE\)     |) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 336.00 Td (| tt_watcher.c        | inotify management, recursive watch, root health     |) Tj ET
