BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 396.00 Td (under power loss.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 372.00 Td (Stability verification:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 360.00 Td (Double-stat \(size + mtime in nanoseconds\) before recording prevents ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 348.00 Td (capturing files during concurrent writes. Unstable reads are re-enqueued ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 336.00 Td (via debounce for retry on the next tick.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 312.00 Td (Per-file directory undo:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 300.00 Td (undo dir --last restores each file to its own previous version, not to a ) Tj ET
