BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 276.00 Td (changes" rather than "revert to a specific moment".) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 252.00 Td (No fsync per record:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 240.00 Td (Records are visible via page cache instantly. Durability is bounded by file ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 228.00 Td (rotation and close. Massive performance gain in bursts \(500 files in <2 ) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 216.00 Td (seconds vs minutes with fsync per record\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 192.00 Td (Daily compaction:) Tj ET
