BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 720.00 Td (+ Enhanced status with CPU, RAM, written deltas, and pending events.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 708.00 Td (+ Expanded documentation for viewing multiple diffs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 696.00 Td (+ Session resumption documentation.) Tj ET
