BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 672.00 Td (+ Practical examples for export and history auditing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 660.00 Td (+ Session resumption: daemon resumes last valid .ttd on restart.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 648.00 Td (+ Updated `undo --to` to accept exact timestamps \("YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS"\) ) Tj ET
