BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 600.00 Td (v1.0:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 588.00 Td (+ Initial version) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 576.00 Td (+ Real-time capture via inotify with debounce \(200 ms coalescing\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 564.00 Td (+ Copy-on-first-change model \(no initial backup\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 552.00 Td (+ Backdated CREATE [original] for pre-existing files) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 540.00 Td (+ Per-file directory undo \(--last, --initial\)) Tj ET
