BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 516.00 Td (+ Double-stat stability verification \(no ghost CREATE 0\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 504.00 Td (+ No fsync per record \(visibility via page cache\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 492.00 Td (+ Automatic daily compaction at 03:00) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 480.00 Td (+ Robust exclusions via path_has_component at any depth) Tj ET
