BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 456.00 Td (+ Named checkpoints: tag/tags/undo --tag) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 444.00 Td (+ Unified diff between versions) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 432.00 Td (+ Log with --since filter) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 420.00 Td (+ Enhanced status \(daemon state, uptime, records, bytes\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 408.00 Td (+ 51/51 regression tests passing) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 50.00 396.00 Td (+ Developed and validated on Intel Core 2 Duo \(2007 hardware\)) Tj ET
